                "title": "Simple Solid Brass Lever",
                "description": "The classic design and easy installation of the 762 Omnia Simple Door Lever, will not disappoint those looking for a leverset that will improve the look of any space. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden) for a very sleek look. The Simple Solid Brass Lever will fit most standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparations. Choose from passage, privacy, and dummy functions.\r\n",
